  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using PCA encoding and avgpool aggregation, comparing it to the singleprofile baseline (config_001). Validation accuracy (0.5907) and F1 (0.5727) improved over the baseline, suggesting multiprofile settings may enhance performance. However, uncertainty remains about the relative impact of aggregation methods and alternative RNA encoders."
